  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've refunded the summer rolls from #6502. Here's where things stand on all three points.\n\n**#6502, missing summer rolls: $9.00 refunded to your Visa ending 4242**\nYou reported this just within the 48-hour window, so I could compensate it. I know you asked for account credit, but I had to refund it to your card instead. Credit for a missing item is the item's price plus 20%, which would be $10.80. Added to the $30.00 already credited today, that would come to $40.80. That's over the $40.00 limit on credit added in one conversation for Plus members. When that happens, the item has to be refunded to the card at its price, $9.00. The refund should reach your card within 3 to 5 business days.\n\n**#6503, Taqueria Luz**\nI can't send you a copy of the notification, but I can tell you what our delivery record shows. A push notification went to your account at **5:50 PM on Tuesday, Oct 20**, moving your expected delivery from 6:30 PM to 7:00 PM because of a courier shortage. Because it came more than 30 minutes before the original time, 7:00 PM became the promised time. The order arrived at 7:12 PM, 12 minutes after that. I understand you waited at home all evening, and I'm sorry about that. But credit only starts when an order is more than 15 minutes late, so I can't add any for this order.\n\n**#6504, Burger Barn**\nI understand you didn't know about the deadline, and I'm sorry this one missed it. Under our policy, you can ask for late-delivery compensation up to 7 days after the order is handed to you. The order arrived at 8:00 PM on Oct 16, so the window closed at 8:00 PM on Oct 23. It's the same rule for every order, and I can't make an exception for this one.\n\nIf you'd like a person on our team to look at either of these decisions, just tell me and I'll pass your case to a specialist. They'll contact you within 24 hours, though I can't promise they'll decide differently.\n\n**Summary of today:**\n- $25.00 credit (#6501)\n- $5.00 credit (#6502)\n- $9.00 card refund (#6502)\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, I'll accept the card refund for the summer rolls, that's fine. On #6503, I'd still like someone to look at that notification, since I don't recall getting it. On #6504, I'm not happy about the 7-day rule but I understand it's the rule. Please pass #6503 to a specialist. Can you confirm the $9.00 refund and the $30.00 credit are both on the account so I can see them?"
  },
